Tool Execution Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant ToolRegistry
    participant Tool
    participant Filesystem

    Agent->>ToolRegistry: invoke(tool_name, args)
    ToolRegistry->>Tool: invoke(args, context)

    Tool->>Tool: Validate path in workspace
    alt Path valid
        Tool->>Filesystem: Read/Edit file
        Filesystem-->>Tool: Result
        Tool-->>ToolRegistry: Ok(output)
    else Path invalid
        Tool-->>ToolRegistry: Err(PathOutsideWorkspace)
    end

    ToolRegistry-->>Agent: Result

    Agent->>Agent: Add tool result to conversation
    Agent->>Agent: Check if all tools complete
    Agent->>Agent: Determine next action